<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vulpes</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">volp-</span></b> ), is (collat. form, nom.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vulpis</span></b> ,
			<i><span class="en">Petr. 58</span></i>;
			<i><span class="en">Avien. 40, 7</span></i>), f.
		cf. Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλώπηξ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a fox.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 28,
				11, 46, § 165</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. S. 2,
				3, 186</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 1, 1, 73</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">id. C. 3, 27, 4
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>cunning</i>, <i>craftiness</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animi sub vulpe latentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 437</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pers. 5, 117</span></i>.—Prov.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b> Jungere vulpes, for
			any absurd or impossible undertaking, <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 3,
				91</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Vulpes pilum mutat, non mores, <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp.
			16</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			Tam facile, quam pirum vulpes comest, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Most. 3, 1, 32</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: vulpes marina, <i>a
				kind of shark</i>: Squalus alopecia, Linn.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 43,
				67, § 145</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
